## 1. PROJECT OVERVIEW

Project Name: GovAI Nexus  
Tagline: Smarter Government. Faster Services. Transparent Governance.  
Organization: Government of Tamil Nadu  
Portal: Super Admin Portal  
Languages: English + Tamil  
Platforms: Web Application + Responsive Mobile

You are working on an existing enterprise-level GovTech platform called GovAI Nexus.

Your task is to design, develop and integrate the complete Super Admin Portal into the existing GovAI Nexus ecosystem.

The Super Admin Portal is the central administrative control centre responsible for managing the entire platform.

It must provide centralized management of:

1. Users and accounts.
2. Citizens, employees and officers.
3. Departments and organizational structures.
4. Roles and permissions.
5. Government services.
6. Government schemes.
7. AI and ML models.
8. System configurations.
9. Security and audit logs.
10. External integrations.
11. Notifications and announcements.
12. Platform monitoring and maintenance.

### Main objectives

- Centralized platform administration.
- Secure user and account management.
- Department and portal management.
- Role-based access control.
- Government service configuration.
- Scheme and document master management.
- AI model and knowledge-base management.
- System health monitoring.
- Security and compliance monitoring.
- Platform-wide audit management.
- Integration management.
- Administrative analytics.

### Mandatory technology stack

Make Python the primary programming language.

