### Important implementation rules

1. Inspect the existing GovAI Nexus repository before development.
2. Reuse existing authentication and database infrastructure.
3. Do not create a separate disconnected admin application.
4. Do not duplicate existing master tables.
5. Implement real database-backed functionality.
6. Connect all administrative actions to actual backend APIs.
7. Implement backend authorization for every administrative action.
8. Do not use hardcoded production statistics.
9. Do not create fake government users or departments.
10. Maintain consistency across all six GovAI Nexus portals.
11. Keep sensitive system operations restricted to authorized Super Admin roles.
12. Use confirmation and audit logging for critical administrative actions.

