- Publishing a service updates the Citizen Portal service directory.
- Updating a scheme's verified description updates the Citizen Portal scheme details and AI knowledge repository.
- Updating an employee's role changes the Employee Portal permissions.
- Updating an officer's jurisdiction changes the records visible in the Officer Portal.
- Deactivating an account blocks new sessions and revokes active sessions according to security policy.

All critical changes must have audit history and appropriate rollback mechanisms.

